#: ../../../CONTRIBUTING.md:228
msgid "Building"
msgstr "ビルド"

#: ../../../CONTRIBUTING.md:241
msgid ""
"The built `renderer.js` is not committed to git. It is generated "
"automatically during `python -m build` via `hatch-build-scripts`. For local "
"development, run `npm run build` after editing TypeScript files."
msgstr ""
"ビルドされた`renderer.js`はgitにコミットされません。`python -m build`の際に`hatch-build-"
"scripts`経由で自動生成されます。ローカル開発では、TypeScriptファイル編集後に`npm run build`を実行してください。"

